# Lab Setup

## Objective
The purpose of this lab is to simulate an end-to-end penetration test against intentionally vulnerable systems in a controlled environment.

## Scope & Authorization
- All targets are intentionally vulnerable virtual machines.
- The lab is isolated and not connected to production or external networks.
- All testing is performed on systems I own or have explicit permission to test.

## Attacker Machine
- OS: Kali Linux
- Role: Attacker workstation

## Target Machines
- Metasploitable 2 (Linux)
- Additional targets will be added later (DVWA, Windows lab)

## Evidence
All screenshots and proof-of-exploitation will be stored in the `evidence/` directory.

